From f47893f192ef6041c979ea02cfdd30558c54c697 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Orbit Dev <dev@orbit.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:30:34 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/31] feat(orbit): QR pairing page with single-use OTP

Add POST /api/orbit/pair-qr (web UI auth) returning {uri, expires_at}
with an Apollo OTP + random passphrase, host cert SHA-256 and usable
IPv4 list (GetAdaptersAddresses). Pin page gains a phone-pairing QR
section with countdown; tray gets "Parear celular...". OTP state moves
to orbit::OtpSlot (same 180 s / single-use rules, testable clock).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
